OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1785784698
OL,3,CGuernsey bowls player Alison Merrien
OL,4,Csecures silver in the Commonwealth
OL,5,CGames
OL,7,FGuernsey bowler Alison Merrien has
OL,8,Fsecured a silver medal in the women's
OL,9,Fsingles gold at the Commonwealth Games
OL,10,F2026 (Sunday 2 August).
OL,12,FThe Guernsey great was beaten by
OL,13,FEngland's Katherine Rednall in a
OL,14,Fclosely fought gold medal match.
OL,16,FThe Anglian bowler won by two sets to
OL,17,Fnil (8-6, 8-3), although the scoreline
OL,18,Fdidn't tell the whole story with
OL,19,FRednall producing crucial shots at the
OL,20,Fright time to pinch the opening set.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/3
