PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1785784698
OL,3,CGuernsey bowls player Alison Merrien
OL,4,Csecures silver in the Commonwealth
OL,5,CGames
OL,7,FIt means pistol shooter Adrian Breton
OL,8,Fis still the last person to take home
OL,9,Fa Gold medal for the island in the
OL,10,FCommonwealth Games, after he secured
OL,11,Fthe top podium spot in the 25m rapid-
OL,12,Ffire in 1990.
OL,14,FMerrien had already guaranteed a medal
OL,15,Ffor Guernsey, after beating Malaysia's
OL,16,FEmma Firyana Saroji 2-0 in their semi-
OL,17,Ffinal in Glasgow on Saturday night.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/3
