OL,3,CGuernsey bowls player Alison Merrien
OL,4,Csecures silver in the Commonwealth
OL,5,CGames
OL,7,FThe silver medal is another award to
OL,8,Fadd to Merrien's accolade of
OL,9,Fachievements after winning her fifth
OL,10,FWomen's Singles World Bowls Title in
OL,11,FJune.
